+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives an asynchronous canonical-instruction loader from its caller. The factory requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`, awaits the returned text, and assigns it to the runtime agent's `instruction` field.
+
+The factory fixes the agent ID to `order-triage`, its action to `classify-for-human-review`, and `canApproveRefunds` to `false`. The loader implementation is caller-owned; this repository does not establish a provider, tools, or refund-approval support.

